					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The fucked up thing with reality benders is that they crave control but total control gets boring fast. Those that go mad with power, they seek free will to bend and to break. They could make things just the way they want, but they know they made it that way. In their twisted mind, they try to get what they want without completely forcing it that way, through force still. It's a bad place to be at the mercy of a demented reality bender.</p> 
				 	]]>
