					<![CDATA[
						 <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I think it was the name of a famous (in-universe) reality bender, but that might be wrong.</span></p> <p>From <a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/grasp-on-reality">The Lombardi Tales, Grasp on Reality</a>:</p> <blockquote> <p>Lemme tell you about reality benders.</p> <p>First off, we like t'call 'em Bixbies. Why? One, in case somebody accidentally says somethin' in front of a civilian, it don't tip 'em off. Two, if yer talking to a reality bender, they might not know all they can do, an' you don't wanna give 'em any ideas.</p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
